                </ab>
                <p>
                    <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-kaṉṉara-tēva<supplied reason="omitted">r</supplied>kku yā
                    <lb n="2" break="no"/>ṇṭu <num value="24">2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 4</num>-vatu
                </p>
                <p>vākūr <hi rend="grantha"><choice><orig>śi</orig><reg>śrī</reg></choice></hi>-m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>la<hi rend="grantha">stā</hi>ṉa
                    
                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>ttu-p <hi rend="grantha">mahāde</hi>varkku tiruvā<supplied reason="omitted">y</supplied>ppāṭi Iru
                    <lb n="4" break="no"/>kku<supplied reason="omitted">m</supplied> maṉṟāṭi kōṉūr nakkaṉ vaitta na
                    <lb n="5" break="no"/>ntā-viḷakku Arai<surplus>vi</surplus>kku vaitta Āṭu
                    <lb n="6"/>nāppatt’ āṟu
                </p>
                <p>
                    Ivai ca<hi rend="grantha">n<choice><orig>t</orig><reg>d</reg></choice>ra</hi>ti<supplied reason="omitted">t</supplied>taval
                </p>
                
