            <div type="translation" source="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01">
                <p n="1">Hail!</p>
                <p n="1-2">24th year of śrī-Kaṉṉara-tēvar.</p>
                <p n="3-6">For the half perpetual lamp for the great Lord of śrī-Mūlastāṉam of Vākūr, donated by Nakkaṉ of Kōṉūr, a shepherd, who lives in Tiruvāy-p-pāṭi, the sheep endowed (for this) are fourty-six.</p>
                <p n="6">This is to last till the moon and the sun will last.</p>
            </div>
            
